{"id": "63425", "title": "竹马是只狼", "author": "灯哑", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 8, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/63/63425.htm", "intro": "现代／校园生活／未定／轻松\r\n关键字：翟清言 沈琦\r\n\r\n文案是神马可以吃吗？\r\n梗大概就是青梅竹马的小攻隐藏不住自己的心意终于决定把小受一口吃掉！大概就是这样吧。\r\n本文1v1 甜 攻宠受\r\n还是那句话，这只是个故事而已，认真你就输了┘﹏└", "base": "files/article/html/63/63425", "chapters": [{"title": "1-7", "file": "9375194.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8-14", "file": "9375195.html", "available": false}, {"title": "15-20", "file": "9375197.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "9375199.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-31", "file": "9375200.html", "available": false}, {"title": "32-36", "file": "9375201.html", "available": false}, {"title": "37-42完结", "file": "9375203.html", "available": false}, {"title": "番外", "file": "9375205.html", "available": false}]}